<title>MEXICO: Mexico details crude prices per barrel by region.</title>
<headline>Mexico details crude prices per barrel by region.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a chart of Mexico's state-owned oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) prices charged per barrel of crude by region, released by Pemex Thursday.</p>
<p>    1995 (avg. price by region) Americas  Europe     Far East</p>
<p>    January			  15.37	15.38	 16.61</p>
<p>    February			 15.87	15.67	 17.59</p>
<p>    March			    16.03	15.48	 16.50</p>
<p>    April			    17.47	15.96	 18.38</p>
<p>    May				17.31	15.41	 17.96</p>
<p>    June			     16.08	13.34	 17.03</p>
<p>    July			     14.66	13.28	 14.19</p>
<p>    August			   14.79	13.99	 15.98</p>
<p>    September			15.17	12.89	 16.20</p>
<p>    October			  14.97	12.93	 15.67</p>
<p>    November			 15.38	14.47	   N/A</p>
<p>    December			 16.58	15.44	 14.73</p>
<p>1996</p>
<p>    January			  16.30	14.35	 17.61</p>
<p>    February			 16.55	15.42	 17.10</p>
<p>    March			    18.44	16.52	 16.05</p>
<p>    April			    19.59	16.17	 17.71</p>
<p>    May				17.92	14.69	 17.65</p>
<p>    June			     17.33	13.90	 18.00</p>
<p>    July			     17.94	15.32	 17.01</p>
<p>    August			   18.92	17.49	 19.10</p>
<p>    September			21.01	19.35	 21.02</p>
<p>    October			  22.53	19.32	 22.49</p>
<p>--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903</p>
